{"id":"c7a1101e7353659c","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-order10-cofinal-map.md","title":"ZFC Order10 Cofinal Map","display":"df-zfc-order10-cofinal-map — ZFC Order10 Cofinal Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order10-cofinal-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order10-cofinal-map"],"display":"df-zfc-order10-cofinal-map — ZFC Order10 Cofinal Map","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-poset]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order10-cofinal-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order10-cofinal-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order10-cofinal-map — ZFC Order10 Cofinal Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,P,Q,\\leq_P,\\leq_Q\\in V\">\\(f,P,Q,\\leq_P,\\leq_Q\\in V\\)</span> (map, posets, and orders)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10CofinalMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10CofinalMap}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}map} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10CofinalMap}_S(f,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(Q,\\leq_Q)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,P,Q)\\land\n\\left[\\forall p_0,p_1\\in P\\;(p_0\\leq_Pp_1\\to f(p_0)\\leq_Qf(p_1))\\right]\\land\n\\left[\\forall q\\in Q\\;\\exists p\\in P\\;(q\\leq_Qf(p))\\right]\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}map} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10CofinalMap}_S(f,P,\\leq_P,Q,\\leq_Q)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(Q,\\leq_Q)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,P,Q)\\land\n\\left[\\forall p_0,p_1\\in P\\;(p_0\\leq_Pp_1\\to f(p_0)\\leq_Qf(p_1))\\right]\\land\n\\left[\\forall q\\in Q\\;\\exists p\\in P\\;(q\\leq_Qf(p))\\right]\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary cofinal map definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd